<title>MEXICO: Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas to Mexico livestock export update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movement update of Texas exports to Mexico, to March 17 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     206	   27,651	8,657</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  6		675	  227</p>
<p>    Breeding females	     23	    1,556	  265</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0		410     29,022</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		150	   20</p>
<p>    Breeding females		0	    1,734	  287</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  1		 50	   10</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    223	    6,553	1,388</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530.</p>
<p>E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
